{"success":true,"data":{"name":"Mobile Graphic Designing – Earners","description":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n  <head>\n     <style>\n       .desc-container {\n         display: flex;\n         flex-direction: column;\n         padding: 16px 13px;\n       }\n       \n       .desc-row {\n         display: flex;\n         align-items: center;\n         margin-bottom: 16px;\n         border-bottom: 1px solid #efefef;\n         padding: 4px 0;\n       }\n       \n       .desc-row-item-title {\n         font-size: 14px;\n         line-height: 22px;\n         margin-right: 6px;\n       }\n\n       .desc-row-item-content {\n         font-size: 14px;\n         line-height: 18px;\n         margin-right: 6px;\n       }\n     </style>\n  </head>\n\n  <body>\n<div class=\"desc-container\">\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-fc1847bc-7fff-bfdb-751a-7890a2602e79\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><strong>Mobile Graphic Designing &ndash; Earners</strong> is a beginner-friendly course designed to help you learn designing from scratch and apply it in real-world projects.</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-0d1eb193-7fff-31f6-660f-1df8e337ac99\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">In this course, you will learn:</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">01.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-71c9e610-7fff-d7a1-c2cc-920093c81bb2\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Basics of design (colors, fonts, layout, composition)</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">02.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-04f3aa58-7fff-e73d-5daf-91ba88b6ec93\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">How to create designs using mobile tools (PixelLab, Canva, Photopea, Snapseed)</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">03.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-31682ec5-7fff-fb9f-97b1-abf467837b5d\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">How to design posts, thumbnails, banners, and logos</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">04.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-d682b243-7fff-0b35-2995-92fb78525266\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">How to use AI tools (ChatGPT, Gemini) for ideas and workflow</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">05.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-7275a939-7fff-17d1-d3a0-ad09b99bcbf9\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Basics of freelancing and portfolio building</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">07.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><strong>2 classes per week (Saturday &amp; Sunday)</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">08.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><strong>Regular assignments for practice</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">09.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\">Course Duration - 6 Months</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">10.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-f0bc7f21-7fff-6fa5-202b-6528dbeb5347\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Doubt support sessions</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">11.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-4168f9ef-7fff-d99a-a6a5-9fdb074153ae\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">This course focuses on practical learning so you can start creating designs confidently and explore opportunities like freelancing, working with creators, or entry-level design roles.</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">12.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\">\n<div>For App/Web Navigation the latest Feature Updates &amp; Student Support please subscribe to our Support YouTube channel:<br /><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@pwstudentsupport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\">https://www.youtube.com/@pwstudentsupport</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","shortDescription":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n <head>\n   <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n   <style>\n     .description-meta-container {\n       display: flex !important;\n       flex-direction: column !important;\n       gap: 14px !important;\n     }\n\n     .child-container {\n       display: flex !important;\n       align-items: center !important;\n       gap: 12px !important;\n     }\n\n     .icon {\n       width: 32px !important;\n       height: 32px !important;\n     }\n\n     .sub-text {\n       font-size: 14px !important;\n       font-weight: 500 !important;\n     }\n\n     .main-text {\n       font-size: 14px !important;\n       font-weight: 600 !important;\n     }\n\n     .text {\n       font-size: 14px !important;\n       font-weight: 500 !important;\n     }\n\n     .text-container {\n       display: flex !important;\n       flex-direction: column !important;\n       gap: 4px !important;\n     }\n   </style>\n </head>\n <body>\n<div class=\"descri